  <static seed="60" source="Library/Union/setMVvectors/an12_2_19.pg">
    <statement><p>Find vectors that satisfy the given conditions:</p>
<p><OL/></p>
<p><LI>
The vector in the opposite direction to <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;u\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt; = \left\lt 2,-3\right&gt;</m> and of
half its length is <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.
<BR><BR/></BR></LI></p>
<p><LI>
The vector of length <m>8</m> and in the same direction as
<m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt; = \left\lt 3,1,-4\right&gt;</m> is <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.
<BR><BR/></BR></LI></p>
<p/>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;-1,1.5\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;4.70679,1.56893,-6.27572\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><OL/></p>
<p><LI>
The vector in the opposite direction to <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;u\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt; = \left\lt 2,-3\right&gt;</m> and of
half its length is</LI></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle -\frac{1}{2} \lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;u\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt; = 
\left\lt -1,1.5\right&gt;</m>
<BR><BR/></BR></p>
<p><LI>
The vector <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;= \left\lt 3,1,-4\right&gt;</m> has length  <m>|\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;| = \sqrt{(3)^2+(1)^2+(-4)^2}
= \sqrt{26}</m>.</LI></p>
<p>Thus the vector of length <m>8</m> and in the same direction as
<m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;</m>  is</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle 8\frac{\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;}{|\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;|} = 8\left\langle \frac{3}{\sqrt{26}}, 
\frac{1}{\sqrt{26}}\right\rangle = 
\left \langle \frac{24}{\sqrt{26}},\frac{8}{\sqrt{26}},\frac{-32}{\sqrt{26}} \right\rangle</m>
<BR><BR/></BR></p>
<p/>
</solution>
